acombs</div></div></li><li><img alt=\"Omruc's treasure\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Omruc's treasure\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Omruc_Treasure_Room_ae0b29.png\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"155\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Omruc's treasure</div></div></li><li><img alt=\"Yasir's ship\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Yasir's ship\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yasir_ship_on_Carlin_375e6a.png\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"300\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Yasir's ship</div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-toolbar\"><div><span class=\"wikia-slideshow-toolbar-counter\" data-counter=\"$1/3\">1/3</span></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Due to a now fixed bug caused by Winter Update 2011, a few players managed to obtain them by logging into Yasir's ship in <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>. This bug prompted CipSoft to make it obtainable after Summer Update 2012.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/bigfoots-burden-quest\">Bigfoot's Burden Quest</a></li><li>Decorations</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnomegate\">Gnomegate</a></li><li>Quests</li><li>Treasure Rooms</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yasir\">Yasir</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["bigfoots-burden-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"bigfoots-burden-quest","quest":"Bigfoot&#39;s Burden Quest","step":"9-0","n":65,"title":"Dungeon Cleaner e Golden Fruits","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":32822,"y":31746,"z":10,"text":"Exposed in Darashia Catacombs Treasure Room , in Omruc 's Treasure Room and Yasir 's ship. Reward in the Bigfoot's Burden Quest , after finishing all 3 Warzones , in a chest near the bank of Gnomegate ."}]}}